[I] SocketCAN userspace utilities and tools

[T] can-utils contains userspace utilities for the Linux CAN subsystem
[T] (SocketCAN). It includes tools to display, record, generate and replay
[T] CAN traffic such as candump, canplayer, cansend and cangen, as well as
[T] ISO-TP, J1939 and gateway tools.

[U] https://github.com/linux-can/can-utils

[A] Can-utils Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

